<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Argosy Gaming started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Argosy Gaming started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers analysts W. Bruce Turner and Tim J. Kelsey said they initiated coverage of Argosy Gaming Co with a hold rating, saying they believed that shares were fully valued.</p>
<p>-- Shares were 1/8 at 7-3/8.</p>
